# Files that Vercel should not upload.
# The live site is only the HTML, CSS, JavaScript and image files.
#
# WHY package.json is on this list: it exists only for the tests. Without it,
# Vercel has nothing to install or build and serves the files exactly as they are.
node_modules
tests
docs
package.json
package-lock.json
README.md
.gitattributes
